WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.815
Hey everybody.
大家好。

00:00:00.815 --> 00:00:03.438
We have a special bonus episode for you here.
我们今天为您准备了一期特别的额外节目。

00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:08.800
We got a very cool invitation Carter Bays and I to participate in this really awesome thing.
Carter Bays和我收到了一份非常酷的邀请，去参与一个超级棒的项目。

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.264
This podcast called Dead Pilots Society.
这个播客名叫《流产试播集社》（Dead Pilots Society）。

00:00:11.264 --> 00:00:22.600
They take unproduced TV pilots that they think were worthy and good scripts but never got shot, never got a table read, some of them never got sold, they just never got a day in court.
他们会挑选那些他们认为很有价值、剧本很棒但从未被拍摄、从未进行过剧本围读，甚至有些从未被卖出，从未见天日的电视剧试播集剧本。

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:36.439
they take that script that they thought was cool and they organize a proper table read with a full cast and they do it kind of as a zoom table read and they bring a dead pilot back to life.
他们会拿出他们觉得很酷的剧本，组织一场由全阵容演员参与的正规剧本围读，有点像Zoom线上围读那样，让一个“死去的”试播集重获新生。

00:00:36.439 --> 00:00:40.157
They reached out to us, MacArthur and I, to do this for a pilot.
他们找到了我和MacArthur，让我们为一个试播集做这件事。

00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:43.526
We wrote a couple years after how I met your mother ended.
那是《老爸老妈浪漫史》完结几年后我们写的。

00:00:43.526 --> 00:00:44.745
We were under a deal.
当时我们签有合约。

00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:46.604
We were developing new TV ideas.
我们在开发新的电视剧创意。

00:00:46.604 --> 00:00:49.740
We're hoping to find that next hit show that would go.
我们希望能找到下一部能够大火的剧集。

00:00:49.740 --> 00:01:08.210
And we are such huge fans of Buffy the Vampire Slayer, that's why we cast Allison Haddigan, that we created this half hour comedy pilot called New York Mythological that's kind of a hymnium with a little bit of Buffy with a little bit of ghost busters and it's like a supernatural romantic comedy set in New York City.
而且我们是《吸血鬼猎人巴菲》的超级大粉丝——这也是为什么我们邀请了Allison Haddigan加盟——我们创作了这个时长半小时的喜剧试播集，名叫《纽约神话》（New York Mythological），它有点像《老爸老妈浪漫史》加上一点《巴菲》，再加一点《捉鬼敢死队》，感觉就像是一部以纽约市为背景的超自然浪漫喜剧。

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:08.907
We loved it.
我们很喜欢它。

00:01:08.907 --> 00:01:10.359
The network passed on it.
但电视台拒绝了它。

00:01:10.359 --> 00:01:11.695
It never got a tablery.
它从未进行过剧本围读。

00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:13.264
It never got a pilot shoot.
它从未被拍摄成试播集。

00:01:13.264 --> 00:01:14.599
It never went anywhere.
它最终不了了之。

00:01:14.599 --> 00:01:25.572
And we were really sad and heartbroken about it, but now, thanks to Deadpilot Society, we have a table read recorded, and that is what we're about to present to you, the fans of how we made your mother.
对此我们感到非常难过和心碎，但现在，多亏了《流产试播集社》，我们录制了一场剧本围读，这就是我们即将呈现给你们——《老爸老妈浪漫史》粉丝们的节目。

00:01:25.572 --> 00:01:26.658
We hope you like it.
希望你们会喜欢。

00:01:26.658 --> 00:01:29.319
There's definitely some hymiumy touches in there.
里面绝对有一些《老爸老妈》式的元素。

00:01:29.959 --> 00:01:30.799
We hope you guys like it.
希望你们会喜欢。

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:31.640
We're really proud of it.
我们为它感到非常自豪。

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:21.359
Welcome to Deadpilot Society, the show that takes comedy pilots from A-list writers that were sold and developed at networks and streamers, but never produced and gives them the table reads they never got a chance to have.
